d shaft voltages\\nOnce bearing failure begins, it also creates a cascade effect that \\naccelerates motor failure. 13\\u2006% of motor failures are caused by  \\nbearing failure, and more than 60\\u2006% of the mechanical failures  \\nin a facility are caused by bearing wear, so learning how to \\ntroubleshoot this potential problem is important. \\n\"}], \"id\": \"ddfce40be3e2af62db650fe2\", \"layer\": \"source_claim\", \"object\": \"term_bearing_failure\", \"operating_conditions\": null, \"original_record\": {\"evidence\": [{\"paragraph_id\": \"P6_B5\", \"quote\": \"Ineffective bearing sealing\"}], \"needs_context_review\": false, \"object\": {\"kind\": \"failure_mode\", \"text\": \"bearing failure\"}, \"operating_conditions\": null, \"qualifier\": \"can\", \"relation\": \"CAUSES\", \"review_note\": \"\", \"subject\": {\"kind\": \"cause\", \"text\": \"ineffective bearing sealing\"}}, \"qualifier\": \"can\", \"relation\": \"CAUSES\", \"review\": {\"candidate_hash\": \"8b6815e6852825a4c49eb129550d062be93035b55fef0dc6e1fac6126403a089\", \"candidate_id\": \"ATOM_3f7b6855b073913b30652f77\", \"decision\": \"accepted\", \"note\": \"Assistant verification only; human review pending. Page 6 P6_B5 explicitly introduces possible causes of bearing failure and lists ineffective bearing sealing. Full paragraph checked; retain can.\", \"reviewed_at\": \"2026-09-14T21:02:35.118311+00:00\", \"reviewer\": \"Codex\", \"reviewer_kind\": \"assistant\", \"run_id\": \"c7f8842146507b286f377664\"}, \"run_id\": \"c7f8842146507b286f377664\", \"section\": \"10 Bearing wear\", \"section_id\": \"fault-10\", \"source_object\": \"556e1a8b7ae2513b1170a312\", \"source_subject\": \"b6f93b7fff0a6a2669c843e3\", \"subject\": \"source_b6f93b7fff0a6a2669c843e3\", \"topic\": \"topic_bearings\", \"warnings\": [\"endpoint_not_literal_in_quote_check_full_paragraph\", \"qualifier_not_literal_in_evidence\"]}" ;
